\v 3 But¦370598 Yonah¦370599 decided to¦370600 run¦370600 away from¦370602 Yahweh so he¦370606 went down to Yafo¦370605 \add !(Joppa¦370605)\add* and¦370606 found¦370606 a ship¦370607 about¦370610 to¦370610 go¦370610 to Tarshish¦370611. He¦370612 paid¦370612 the fare¦370613 and¦370614 went aboard to go with¦370615 them¦370617 to¦370618 Tarshish¦370618 to get away from Yahweh.
